{"unit_id":"LQ-1123__paste-to-workspace#card-1","repo":"LQ-1123/paste-to-workspace","commit":"6633a5847edf00e3d476fb38ddbf927d9e31fdee","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"paste-to-workspace 是面向 DSH Web 的插件，可把粘贴的图片和拖入的文件保存到当前会话工作区。它通过浏览器端预览条与宿主文件路由协作，在发送时把文件路径加入同一条消息。用户可以发送纯文件、查看图片缩略图、下载文件卡片，并在发送前移除待发项；无需额外 API Key。适用于希望把本地材料顺手带入对话的 Web 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:981-1088","lib/index.js:190-230"]}
{"unit_id":"LQ-1123__paste-to-workspace#card-2","repo":"LQ-1123/paste-to-workspace","commit":"6633a5847edf00e3d476fb38ddbf927d9e31fdee","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"paste-to-workspace is a DSH Web plugin that saves pasted images and dropped files in the active session workspace. A preview strip shows pending items; sending adds their paths to the message. Users can send files without text, preview images, download file cards, or remove pending items.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:981-1088","lib/index.js:190-230"]}
